WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.200
Hi, I'm your interviewer.

00:03.200 --> 00:13.200
Let's begin your diagnostic interview to assess your readiness across Screening, Behavioural, Technical, and Culture Fit rounds. Each round will take around 10 to 15 minutes.

00:13.200 --> 00:19.235
By the end of the interview, you'll get your hirability score and the areas you need to improve.
